    "https://www.wsc.edu/directory-record/28897/adjunct-faculty-undergraduate-courses-all-subjects-": {
      "title": "Job opening for Adjunct Faculty",
      "description": "Job opening for Adjunct Faculty - Undergraduate Courses (All Subjects) - Wayne State College Nebraska Skip to content home page myWSC Open sub menu of Resources for Back Resources for Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Open sub menu of Alumni & Friends Back Alumni & Friends Get Involved Give to Wayne State Activities & Events Alumni Awards Wayne State Foundation News Events Campus Map Directory Menu Search Open sub menu of Academics Back Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Online Degrees Non-Degree Programs Schools & Departments Signature Programs & Opportunities Pre-Professional Preparation Academic Services & Support Explore Academics at WSC Open sub menu of Cost & Aid Back Cost & Aid Cost of Attendance Financial Aid Scholarships Our Tuition Guarantee Estimate Your Cost Explore Cost & Aid Open sub menu of Admissions Back Admissions Apply to WSC Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Transfer to WSC Adult Degree Completion Military & Veteran Students International Students Schedule a Visit Explore Admissions Open sub menu of Campus Life Back Campus Life Housing Food & Dining Recreation & Fitness Get Involved Support Services Campus Safety Cultural Enrichment Explore Campus Life Open sub menu of Athletics Back Athletics Official Athletics Website Get Recruited Club Sports Intramural Sports Sports Camps Support Wildcat Athletics Athletics Calendar Explore Wildcat Athletics Open sub menu of About WSC Back About WSC Who We Are College Leadership Our Campus Honors & Distinctions Accreditation Student Outcomes Service & Outreach Partners in Success Employment About Wayne State Home About WSC Employment Employment Opportunities Faculty Adjunct Faculty - Undergraduate Courses (All Subjects) Job opening for Adjunct Faculty - Undergraduate Courses (All Subjects) Position type: Faculty Date opened: N/A Wayne State College accepts applications on a continuous basis for a pool of qualified adjunct faculty to teach undergraduate courses across a variety of disciplines. The number of positions varies each semester based on the instructional needs of the College. Academic departments review the adjunct pool when teaching needs arise. Teaching assignments may include day, evening, off-campus, online, hybrid, or blended courses. Appointments may be renewable based on institutional need, funding, and performance. Compensation $1,000 per credit hour Required qualifications The Higher Learning Commission (HLC) requires a master’s degree in the area of specialization, or a master’s degree in another field with at least 18 graduate credit hours in the teaching discipline. How to apply: Submit the following materials to Wayne State College Human Resources: WSC Employment Application (PDF) Curriculum vitae (CV) College transcripts Important: You must download and save the employment application PDF before completing the form fields. Application materials may be submitted by: Email: hr@wsc.edu Fax: 402-375-7413 Mail:  Wayne State College Human Resources, 1111 Main Street, Wayne, NE 68787 <-- Back to all job openings Questions? Contact: WSC Human Resources Hahn Administration, Room 220 Telephone: 402-375-7403 Email: hr@wsc.edu The Nebraska State Colleges are equal opportunity institutions and prohibit unlawful discrimination and harassment. Wayne State College has designated an individual to coordinate nondiscrimination efforts to comply with regulations implementing Title II of the Americans with Disabilities Act, Titles VI and VII of the Civil Rights Act, Title IX of the Education Amendments of 1972, and Section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act. Inquiries regarding nondiscrimination policies and practices may be directed to the College’s compliance coordinator, Alicia Dorcey McIntosh . No application fee. Ever. Ready to get started? Apply today Schedule a visit Related Links Political Science Education Degree Bradley Weber, M.M. Kucera Retires After 30 Years as NBDC Consultant... Wayne State College 1111 Main St. Wayne, NE 68787 402-375-7000 Find us on Facebook Watch us on YouTube Follow us on Twitter See us on Instagram Apply for Admission Visit Campus Cost & Aid Net Price Calculator Accreditation myWSC Campus Map Campus Directory Library Employment Opportunities Accessibility Statement Consumer Info Emergency Information Privacy Policy Title IX Information All content © 2026  Wayne State College Nebraska. All Rights Reserved. Website Feedback Member, Nebraska State College System Designed and powered by Jadu . Search Search Press Enter to search or Esc to close Open sub menu of Academics Back Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Online Degrees Non-Degree Programs Schools & Departments Signature Programs & Opportunities Pre-Professional Preparation Academic Services & Support Explore Academics at WSC Open sub menu of Cost & Aid Back Cost & Aid Cost of Attendance Financial Aid Scholarships Our Tuition Guarantee Estimate Your Cost Explore Cost & Aid Open sub menu of Admissions Back Admissions Apply to WSC Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Transfer to WSC Adult Degree Completion Military & Veteran Students International Students Schedule a Visit Explore Admissions Open sub menu of Campus Life Back Campus Life Housing Food & Dining Recreation & Fitness Get Involved Support Services Campus Safety Cultural Enrichment Explore Campus Life Open sub menu of Athletics Back Athletics Official Athletics Website Get Recruited Club Sports Intramural Sports Sports Camps Support Wildcat Athletics Athletics Calendar Explore Wildcat Athletics Open sub menu of About WSC Back About WSC Who We Are College Leadership Our Campus Honors & Distinctions Accreditation Student Outcomes Service & Outreach Partners in Success Employment About Wayne State myWSC Open sub menu of Resources for Back Resources for Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Open sub menu of Alumni & Friends Back Alumni & Friends Get Involved Give to Wayne State Activities & Eve